#kaocha/v1
;; Rung-4/5 raster-bridge suite — run via `-M:raster-test`. Its own test root
;; (test/raster, added to the classpath only by that alias) so `-M:test` never
;; resolves raster: typed.clj.checker, native access, the Vector API module.
{:tests [{:id          :raster
          :test-paths  ["test/raster"]
          :ns-patterns ["-test$"]}]}
